WEBVTT

00:10:56.496 --> 00:11:01.121
the biggest shame trigger is do
not be perceived as weak.

00:11:02.579 --> 00:11:04.787
So just think about that
calculus for a second.

00:11:04.829 --> 00:11:06.912
I'm asking people to be vulnerable.

00:11:07.496 --> 00:11:10.787
Ninety nine percent of them are raised to
believe that vulnerability is weakness,

00:11:11.246 --> 00:11:15.662
and they know in their heart that they'll
experience shame if they're perceived

00:11:15.662 --> 00:11:20.787
as weak. And that's so it becomes
a very big ask for.

00:11:22.371 --> 00:11:29.496
People who really value complying with
masculine norms in terms of women

00:11:29.496 --> 00:11:32.912
and feminine norms, the number
one shame trigger is.